WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.566 --> 00:00:09.870
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.480
- Vladimir Putin has a trick up his sleeve

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.043
and he's finally using it.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.020
It's a weapon he's been
holding onto for years

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.493
waiting for this moment.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.260
The weapon is this umbilical
cord that ties Russia

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.930
to Europe, infrastructure and fuel,

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.253
now a weapon of war.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.970
It starts up here in this
freezing cold part of Russia

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.240
where under the snow and ice
there's energy from plants

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.910
and animals that lived a
hundred million years ago

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.010
now stored in the cracks of rocks

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.390
thousands of meters underground.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.570
From here it is sucked up and
sent through pipes that are

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.480
in land and water all the way to Europe

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:00.300
where it is burned in
power plants to boil water

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.430
to turn turbines and make electricity

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.810
to keep the lights on in Europe.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.390
The gas is also burned
right in European homes

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.880
to cook a meal or to heat a home.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.460
Oh, and it's not just one big pipeline.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.910
Natural gas moves through a
mindbogglingly massive network

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.373
of pipes linking Russia to Europe.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.150
What I want to do here is quickly get you

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.310
up to speed on what is happening

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.320
and how these pipelines have been turned

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.073
into a weapon in a weird
version of hybrid warfare.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.810
We call it hybrid because you
have two things going on here.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:40.920
You've got this traditional

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.810
old school style war playing out,

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.420
you've got artillery and
foot soldiers and cruelty

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:46.380
against civilians,

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.570
you have the conquest
an annexation of land.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.790
That's like old school style war.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.490
And yet Putin hasn't
declared an official war.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.110
He's covering this
whole thing up back home

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.420
