00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.190
and you see one of these
like weird looking buildings

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:43.440
with a bunch of pipes,
give it like a salute

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:46.710
because inside of this
plant they're making ammonia

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.600
which is used to make fertilizer

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.370
which is used to grow your food.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.470
They make the menthol for your toothpaste

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.810
and they make make tons of
chemicals that are necessary

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:58.770
for building cars, which is
Germany's biggest export

00:11:58.770 --> 00:11:59.940
I didn't really grasp this before

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.910
but I now see that our
modern industrial economy

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.130
is like founded on chemicals

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:08.850
and you need a lot of natural
gas to make chemicals.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:11.190
So as Russia strangles
Europe from natural gas

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:15.480
it's having an effect on paper
and steel and so much more.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.250
You need energy for all this stuff.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.320
So when the cost of energy goes up

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.538
the cost of everything goes up.

00:12:20.538 --> 00:12:23.598
- Inflation and soaring
prices are biting hard.

00:12:23.598 --> 00:12:26.748
- The price of olive
oil has gone up by 27%.

00:12:26.748 --> 00:12:29.628
- Consumer prices in
Germany reach 8% higher

00:12:29.628 --> 00:12:31.368
than one year earlier.

00:12:31.368 --> 00:12:35.418
That's a level not seen
since the 1970s oil crisis.

00:12:35.418 --> 00:12:37.608
- And this is exactly what Putin wants.

00:12:37.608 --> 00:12:39.588
This is his next move in the war.

00:12:39.588 --> 00:12:41.058
And notice the timing here.

00:12:41.058 --> 00:12:43.188
It's about to get really cold in Europe.

00:12:43.188 --> 00:12:45.318
Another mind blowing fact here is

00:12:45.318 --> 00:12:48.198
that 70% of the energy that is used

00:12:48.198 --> 00:12:51.306
by European households is
just to heat the homes.

00:12:51.306 --> 00:12:53.796
70% and about half of European homes

00:12:53.796 --> 00:12:55.626
rely on natural gas for heat.

00:12:55.626 --> 00:12:57.786
And where does that natural gas come from?

00:12:57.786 --> 00:12:59.916
Russia, well no, not Russia.

00:12:59.916 --> 00:13:01.236
It doesn't come from Russia anymore.

00:13:01.236 --> 00:13:03.066
It now needs to come from somewhere else

00:13:03.066 --> 00:13:04.056
somewhere that doesn't have a bunch

00:13:04.056 --> 00:13:06.036
of pipelines that can pipe it in cheaply.

00:13:06.036 --> 00:13:08.706
It's either that or
Europeans freeze this winter.

00:13:08.706 --> 00:13:10.899
Cue the current panic in Europe.

00:13:10.899 --> 00:13:14.816
(speaking in foreign language)

00:13:19.199 --> 00:13:20.699
- Two of our producers, Jack and Paji

00:13:20.699 --> 00:13:21.809
were recently in Berlin

00:13:21.809 --> 00:13:25.079
and I asked them to go look
for electric heaters to see

00:13:25.079 --> 00:13:26.609
if like it was easy to buy them.

00:13:26.609 --> 00:13:28.649
Like is this panic real

00:13:28.649 --> 00:13:30.149
- Is this thing on?

00:13:30.149 --> 00:13:30.982
- Hey Johnny.

00:13:30.982 --> 00:13:33.299
- We're about to like walk
into an electronics store

00:13:33.299 --> 00:13:35.219
and see if this is actually true

00:13:35.219 --> 00:13:38.499
and people are buying these
electric heaters like crazy

00:13:41.857 --> 00:13:45.774
(speaking in foreign language)

00:13:51.632 --> 00:13:53.102
This is actually happening.

00:13:53.102 --> 00:13:56.312
They had like five or six
still in the store on display

00:13:56.312 --> 00:13:58.922
but he said they have
nothing left back in storage.

00:13:58.922 --> 00:14:01.892
And once those five or
six radiators are sold,

00:14:01.892 --> 00:14:03.122
they're not getting new ones.

00:14:03.122 --> 00:14:04.262
- Electric heater sales

00:14:04.262 --> 00:14:06.392
all over Germany seem to be going up.

00:14:06.392 --> 00:14:09.392
76% this year over last by one estimate.

00:14:09.392 --> 00:14:11.522
Okay, but I hate to
break it to you Germany.

00:14:11.522 --> 00:14:13.382
The electricity that you need to run these

00:14:13.382 --> 00:14:16.352
electric heaters is now
way more expensive too

00:14:16.352 --> 00:14:19.022
because natural gas is also
used to make electricity

00:14:19.022 --> 00:14:20.552
and it drives up the price

00:14:20.552 --> 00:14:22.472
for all other forms of
electricity as well.

00:14:22.472 --> 00:14:25.232
So yeah, Putin played his big wild card

00:14:25.232 --> 00:14:27.902
in this economic war by
turning off the taps.

00:14:27.902 --> 00:14:29.642
And let's walk through
his calculations here

00:14:29.642 --> 00:14:30.572
cause it wasn't just to like

00:14:30.572 --> 00:14:32.312
make European suffer as payback.

00:14:32.312 --> 00:14:33.145
He has an end game.

00:14:33.145 --> 00:14:35.642
His goal is that by doing so
the people will get fed up

00:14:35.642 --> 00:14:37.322
and go to their leaders and be like

00:14:37.322 --> 00:14:40.922
why are we supporting a war
in Ukraine at our own expense?

00:14:40.922 --> 00:14:43.412
And under pressure the leaders
in Europe would then fracture

00:14:43.412 --> 00:14:45.572
and be more likely to go
to President Zelenskyy

00:14:45.572 --> 00:14:48.122
who they have lots of
leverage over and pressure him

00:14:48.122 --> 00:14:51.332
into making a deal with
Putin to stop the war

00:14:51.332 --> 00:14:54.131
give Putin all the land that
he's annexed and move on.

00:14:54.131 --> 00:14:54.964
- President Putin has announced

00:14:54.964 --> 00:14:57.180
the annexation of four regions of Ukraine

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.520
that are controlled by Russian forces

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.020
in the biggest seizure

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.477
of territory in Europe
since the second world war.

00:15:02.477 --> 00:15:05.570
- And this would mean a big win for Putin.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:10.426
Moves and counter moves,
that's what this is.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:14.173
And let me just say Putin's
plan is not not working.

00:15:17.816 --> 00:15:19.886
This is happening right now
and it's changing every day.

00:15:19.886 --> 00:15:21.236
So by the time you're watching it, boy

00:15:21.236 --> 00:15:22.226
things could have changed.

00:15:22.226 --> 00:15:23.546
But there is a growing movement

00:15:23.546 --> 00:15:26.516
especially in Germany to
protest the sanctions.

00:15:26.516 --> 00:15:28.349
and this military aid to Ukraine.

00:15:29.551 --> 00:15:33.468
(speaking in foreign language)

00:15:45.991 --> 00:15:47.393
People are taking to the streets,

00:15:47.704 --> 00:15:49.369
they're fed up with higher prices

00:15:49.369 --> 00:15:52.093
for something they
don't think is worth it.

00:15:52.093 --> 00:15:56.010
(speaking in foreign language)

00:15:58.907 --> 00:16:02.357
And as winter comes and the
demand for gas increases

00:16:02.357 --> 00:16:04.907
to heat homes and keep the economy alive

00:16:04.907 --> 00:16:07.097
this tension will only get worse.

00:16:07.222 --> 00:16:10.762
Just as Putin planned using
his energy weapon just

00:16:10.762 --> 00:16:13.162
at the right time to
inflict the most amount

00:16:13.162 --> 00:16:15.602
of pain on Europe's economy.

00:16:15.602 --> 00:16:19.519
(speaking in foreign language)

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.240
Okay, wait a minute, did you catch this?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:26.810
We're talking about like high
stakes, like global conflict

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:29.240
and Putin is invoking this folk tale

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:32.510
in which a clever fox
presumably Putin himself

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:36.320
outsmarts this dumb wolf
by tricking him to going

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:38.240
down to a frozen lake and putting his tail

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:40.460
in a hole in the ice to
try to like catch fish.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.670
But eventually the wolf's tail
freezes and the wolf is stuck

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.370
until a bunch of villagers
come down and beat him up.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:48.320
By the way, I talked
to a Russian about this

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.090
and she told me that like the fox

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.460
is not portrayed as like
a a role model here.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.130
Like the fox is actually like
a pretty unsavory character.

00:16:55.379 --> 00:16:57.329
And yet Putin wants to be the fox,

00:16:57.609 --> 00:16:59.202
and the EU is the wolf.

00:17:01.074 --> 00:17:03.417
Putin man, he's just
quite the storyteller.

00:17:05.586 --> 00:17:09.066
So that is what is going
down here in this conflict.

00:17:09.066 --> 00:17:13.176
It is hybrid warfare with
a particular 2022 flavor,

00:17:13.176 --> 00:17:14.826
something we've never seen before

00:17:14.826 --> 00:17:15.760
and we don't really
know what happens next.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.130
It's developing right
now, but allow me to share

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:20.500
with you a few closing
facts that we should keep

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:23.830
in mind that will help us make
sense of this economic war.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.840
First, turning off the pipelines

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:29.140
to Europe doesn't just hurt
Europe it hurts Russia too.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:31.660
In the short term they've
been making tons of money

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:34.030
off of this surge in natural gas prices.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.710
But in doing so, they
have severed their ties

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.410
with their best highest
paying customer, Europe.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.480
They're now looking east for new customers

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.950
maybe in China and India

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.680
but none will pay the prices
that Europe was willing to.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.170
Oh, and plus they don't
have nearly the network

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.880
of pipelines that they have into Europe.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.410
Building those takes decades.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:54.240
But somehow this was worth it to Russia

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.640
to inflict short term pain on Europe

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.910
in exchange for a long term
hit to Russia's gas industry.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.370
Second, and speaking of long term, yes

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.810
this is painful for Europe right now

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:07.380
but what it's gonna do is
quickly force them to look

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.540
for new places to find their energy.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.010
Spoiler alert, in the short term

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.500
Qatar is gonna get way
rich off of all of this.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.447
Richer than they already
are, if you can imagine.

00:18:15.447 --> 00:18:17.520
But the point is that this will accelerate

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:21.570
Europe's already started
transition away from fossil fuels.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.760
They're now being forced to speed that up.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.920
In other words, if they can
weather this difficult time

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:28.260
they will come out way better
off than they did before.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:29.490
And Putin will come away

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.890
with way less economic leverage over them.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.390
And this gets to my last point

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.910
and this is a little bit more
of my opinion and prediction

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.790
on the situation, which is
that this guy, Vladimir Putin

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:41.430
I think has overplayed his hand once again

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.860
using all of his leverage in one swoop

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:46.620
and dramatically underestimating
its ability to work.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.453
I mean, just go back.

00:18:47.453 --> 00:18:49.380
He miscalculated his
army's ability to take

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:52.038
over Ukraine's capital very swiftly.

00:18:52.038 --> 00:18:53.850
He miscalculated his army's
ability to hold land.

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:55.410
He miscalculated the response

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.560
of the Ukrainian military and
people to resist his invasion.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.950
He miscalculated the response
from the west and now it seems

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.590
like he once again has
miscalculated his ability

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:07.500
to force Europe to stop supporting Ukraine

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.850
through energy blackmail.

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.850
He seems to be 0 for
five, which is good news

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.220
until you realize that every time he loses

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.160
one of these bets, he
escalates the conflict.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.220
What's scary is that Putin can't lose.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.120
He's not allowed to.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.640
If he loses, he gets thrown
out of power back home.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.500
So I think he'll keep digging in his heels

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.510
using all of the tricks in his arsenal.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:30.180
I'm not totally sure
where it goes from here

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:33.723
but I can tell you that this
conflict is far from over.

